the camera's floor in 25-45 kHz: ~-2 dB SPL (quiet place; a hall's own ultrasound is usually higher)
the ear's: ~10-20 dB SPL in 2-16 kHz in a quiet room; a hall's 70-90 dB drowns any hiss

